# Acceptance test guides
- Acceptance tests are written using Gherkin syntax 
- Always add new acceptance tests to tests/acceptance folder in feature files
- For each test scenario, implement it in a way that it only contains 1 Given, 1 When and 1 Then. Add additional lines if needed with "And". Example:
```
Scenario: sample attributes full description
  When I am on "/adminSample/admin"
  Then I should see "Source material identifiers:David Lambert & BGI"
  And I should see "Geographic location (country and/or sea,region):Antarctica, Inexpressible Island, Ross Sea"
  And I should see "Alternative names:PYGAD"
```
- Support functions for acceptance tests are located in tests/_support folder
- Do not add new support functions unless there is no alternative, always attempt to leverage existing functions first